				{
					"id": 761310612,
					"content": "这是什么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310613,
					"content": "信息显示，这座基地的存在…源自那位「漆黑之王」的意志。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310614,
					"content": "它的建成时间，也比我们之前见过的设施要晚许多。它的底部通向月心，那里被挖出了一道罅缝。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310615,
					"content": "源源不断的古月之力从月心罅缝涌出，成为了基地的能源。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310616,
					"content": "它的目的，是将月球打造成…天基武器！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310617
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310617,
					"content": "天、天基武器？那难道那位「漆黑之王」是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310618,
					"content": "大概就是归来的龙王尼伯龙根。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310619
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761310619,
					"content": "是龙王回来了？！我们也太厉害了吧，这是闯到什么地方来了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310620
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310620,
					"content": "天理来完龙王来，龙王来完我们来！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310621
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310621,
					"content": "向着星辰与深渊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310622
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761310622,
					"content": "这样说的话…前面的路我们得打起十二分警惕了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310623
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310623,
					"content": "哥伦比娅，万一有不对劲的事，你要保护好我们呀…咦？哥伦比娅？哥伦比娅呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310624
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310624,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}！哥伦比娅不见了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310625
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310625,
					"content": "…是什么时候？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310626
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761310626,
					"content": "完全没有感觉到…黑蛋，你看见哥伦比娅了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310627
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310627,
					"content": "没有，我一直在读取终端里的信息…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310628
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310628,
					"content": "糟、糟糕了啊…保护我们的人居然不见了！有鬼啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310629
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310629,
					"content": "（哥伦比娅绝对不会不告而别，一定有其他原因。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310630
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761310630,
					"content": "（会和黑蛋有关吗？不，她一直在读取终端的信息。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310631
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761310631,
					"content": "（那难道是…？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310632
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761310632,
					"content": "而且站在这里，那种奇怪的熟悉感更深了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310633
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥伦比娅"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310633,
					"content": "（看来哥伦比娅消失的原因和她所说的熟悉感有关，这座基地里到底有什么？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310634
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761310634,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，我们现在可怎么办呀？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310635,
						761310637
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310635,
					"content": "去卢沙里姆的研究室。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310636
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761310636,
					"content": "嗯，那里一定有关于这座基地的秘密，或许也能找到关于哥伦比娅消失的线索。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310641
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310641,
					"content": "但我们的路线要经过前方的警戒设施，不能触发基地的全面警报。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310642
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310642,
					"content": "有没有办法关闭这些警戒设施？让我看看…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310643,
						761310645,
						761310647,
						761310649,
						761310651
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310643,
					"content": "观察",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310644
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761310644,
					"content": "那边就是通向卢沙里姆研究室的路线，但我们要先想办法关闭警戒设施。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310653
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310653,
					"content": "看起来，我们要先走左边的房间上到二楼，那里是警戒控制室。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310654
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310654,
					"content": "找个办法，溜进去看看吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310645,
					"content": "观察",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310646
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761310646,
					"content": "这个房间好像可以通向二楼。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310653
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310647,
					"content": "观察",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310648
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761310648,
					"content": "工程蓝图显示，左侧二楼和右侧二楼的房间是警戒控制室。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310653
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310649,
					"content": "观察",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310650
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761310650,
					"content": "好像已经崩塌了，没有能通过的路。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310653
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310651,
					"content": "观察",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310652
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761310652,
					"content": "工程蓝图显示，左侧二楼和右侧二楼的房间是警戒控制室。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310653
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310637,
					"content": "事已至此，先撤退吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310638
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761310638,
					"content": "我知道你是想开个玩笑让我别害怕…嗯…我要鼓起勇气！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310639
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310639,
					"content": "我们要去找哥伦比娅，我们不会把她丢在这里的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310640
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310640,
					"content": "我们应该去卢沙里姆的研究室。那里一定有关于这座基地的秘密，或许也能找到关于哥伦比娅消失的线索。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310641
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				}
			]
