					"content": "只是这样的话，用那座「伊比尼伯龙之眼」就可以办到吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310707
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310707,
					"content": "是不是还有什么内容我漏看了？我再检查一下！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310708
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310708,
					"content": "呜哇！末尾果然还有一段注脚！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310709
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310709,
					"content": "「给我的『女儿』，宁宁」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310710
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310710,
					"content": "宁宁？！等等…黑蛋，你是卢沙里姆的女儿？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310711
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310711,
					"content": "那你怎么也变成了现在这个样子？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310712,
					"content": "怎么会…我不知道…我没有这些记忆。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310713
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310713,
					"content": "我们得去月心那里看看。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310714
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761310714,
					"content": "那、那哥伦比娅呢？还没找到她消失的线索…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310715
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761310715,
					"content": "她的消失或许也和月心有关。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761310716
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761310716,
					"content": "对哦，她前面说的熟悉的感觉，也只可能是月心了…我们快走！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
